&CONTROL
  calculation = 'relax'
  prefix = 'zr'
  outdir = './tmp'
  pseudo_dir = '/home/otnielsitepu/pseudopotential'
  nstep = 250
/

&SYSTEM
  ibrav = 4
  a = 3.23923
  c = 5.17222
  nat = 2
  ntyp = 1
  ecutwfc = 60
  ecutrho = 480
  occupations = 'smearing'
  smearing = 'mv'
  degauss = 0.02
/

&ELECTRONS
  conv_thr = 1.0d-8
/

&IONS
/

ATOMIC_SPECIES
  Zr 91.224 Zr.pbe-spn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF

ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom
Zr  -0.00000   1.87017   1.29306
Zr   1.61962   0.93509   3.87917

K_POINTS automatic
 12 12 1 0 0 0
